abstract: >-
  Arbogast is a certificate-first computational mathematics library for finite exact
  cohomology, pinned number-field arithmetic, finite Kummer and 2-Selmer problems, finite exact
  deformation theory, validated numerical algebraic geometry, bounded finite-precision p-adic
  arithmetic, symmetry, and Hurwitz arithmetic. Its proof boundaries keep finite residue classes,
  numerical evidence, recognition candidates, exactification, local reduction fragments, and
  exact scoped conclusions at distinct levels. It separates discovery from verification and
  records mathematical results in provenance-preserving claim graphs. Certified environmental
  readiness binds an interpreter, package and lock identity, runtime registries, capabilities,
  executor semantics, and artifact custody to an exact campaign plan before dispatch.
